d\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is modern interior design for a Pitampura home?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Clean lines, an open layout, neutral colours and practical furniture. It suits builder floors, where it makes rooms feel more spacious.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a modern home include a puja room?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. A puja room can be designed in a simple, modern style with good lighting and storage, so it fits the rest of the home.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is modern design good for offices too?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Simple layouts, good lighting and durable modern finishes work well for offices, clinics and showrooms.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you add warmth to modern interior design?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Wood, fabric, warm lighting and a few personal pieces keep a modern home from feeling cold.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Modern Interior Design in Pitampura, Delhi\",\"serviceType\":\"Modern Interior Design\",\"description\":\"Modern interior design in Pitampura by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/pitampura/services-modern-interior-design\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Pitampura, Delhi\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"\n\n    <style>\n        /* Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Structural variables */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700; \n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/e2.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px; \n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); \n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(34px, 7vw, 62px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 850px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 40px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff; \n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 26px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-around;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            max-width: 1000px;\n            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 15px 25px;\n            margin: 10px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            transition: background-color 0.3s;\n        }\n        .reason-list li:hover {\n            background-color: #6d655a;\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Modern Interior Design in Pitampura, Delhi</h1>\n            <p>Sleek, Functional, and Timeless Spaces</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <p>Our modern interior design services in Pitampura, Delhi prioritize the art of simplicity, elegance, and high-performance functionality. We craft interiors characterized by clean architectural lines, sophisticated neutral palettes, and avant-garde contemporary furniture—creating spaces that feel expansive, organized, and visually serene even in the heart of North Delhi’s urban landscape.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Balancing Style with Practicality</h2>\n            <p>\"We design homes, corporate offices, and retail spaces that fuse high-end aesthetic appeal with effortless everyday usability. From intelligent spatial flow and ergonomic furniture to automated lighting and curated décor, every element is precision-engineered to create a cohesive, modern environment tailored specifically to your needs.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Minimalist Mastery</h3>\n                <p>Creating layouts that achieve maximum impact through intentional negative space and a \"less is more\" architectural approach.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Material Innovation</h3>\n                <p>Expert application of industrial-sleek materials—glass, polished concrete, and brushed metals—integrated with warm natural textures for a balanced feel.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Ergonomic Intelligence</h3>\n                <p>Modern interior design with the human body in mind, ensuring that every modern piece of furniture and fixture supports health, comfort, and productivity.</p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Us</h2>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>Masters of Contemporary Design Principles and Urban Minimalism</li>\n                <li>Customized Solutions Across Residential, Office, and Retail Sectors</li>\n                <li>Professional End-to-End Project Handling with Turnkey Precision</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                Ready to inhabit the future? Partner with Pitampura’s premier modern design specialists to build a space that transcends time.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What is modern interior design for a Pitampura home?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Clean lines, an open layout, neutral colours and practical furniture. It suits builder floors, where it makes rooms feel more spacious.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can a modern home include a puja room?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. A puja room can be designed in a simple, modern style with good lighting and storage, so it fits the rest of the home.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Is modern design good for offices too?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Simple layouts, good lighting and durable modern finishes work well for offices, clinics and showrooms.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How do you add warmth to modern interior design?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Wood, fabric, warm lighting and a few personal pieces keep a modern home from feeling cold.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n    </div>\n"}